<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Union seeks 25% pay rise at De Beers - paper.</title>
<headline>Union seeks 25% pay rise at De Beers - paper.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's National Union of Mineworkers (NUM) has put forward an opening demand for a 25 percent wage increase for about 5,000 members on De Beers mines, the Business Day newspaper reported on Thursday.</p>
</text>
